{"id":"9601bee9d8ccaf30","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-determined-game.md","title":"ZFC Determined Game","display":"df-zfc-determined-game — ZFC Determined Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-determined-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-determined-game","58-df-zfc-game2-determined-game"],"display":"df-zfc-determined-game — ZFC Determined Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-winning-strategy]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-determined-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-determined-game</span><span>58-df-zfc-game2-determined-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-determined-game — ZFC Determined Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"58-df-winning-strategy\">58-df-winning-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,T,A\\in V\">\\(M,T,A\\in V\\)</span> (move set, legal-position tree, and payoff set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau,p\\in V\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau,p\\in V\\)</span> (strategy and play witnesses)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Strategy}_S,\\mathrm{Outcome}_S,\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S,\\mathrm{Outcome}_S,\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}\\)</span> (predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"58-df-winning-strategy\">58-df-winning-strategy</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (play typing)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}\\)</span> (player-II winning-strategy predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2DeterminedGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2DeterminedGame}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\omega,M)\\land\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\\land p\\notin A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\omega,M)\\land\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\\land p\\notin A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}(\\sigma,T,A,M)\\lor\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}(\\sigma,T,A,M)\\lor\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Determinacy means that one of the two players has a winning strategy for the same legal-position tree, payoff set, and move carrier.</li>\n<li>The former <code>58-df-zfc-game3-determined-game</code> alias was removed because its undeclared <code>WinStrat(H,W,i,\\sigma)</code> signature had no compatible upstream definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-winning-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"b74c79bf773960d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-winning-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-winning-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"b74c79bf773960d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Strategy}_S,\\mathrm{Outcome}_S,\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}$ (predicates from [[58-df-winning-strategy]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}$ (play typing)","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,T,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Strategy}_S,\\mathrm{Outcome}_S,\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2DeterminedGame}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\omega,M)\\land\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\\land p\\notin A)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}(\\sigma,T,A,M)\\lor\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}determined\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DeterminedGame}_S(T,A,M)","display":true}],"bytes":1935,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1851","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-determi